Package: panache
Title: Format Markdown, Quarto, and R Markdown Documents
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
      "Johan",
      "Larsson",
      email = "johan@jolars.co",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4029-5945")
    )
Description: Format Markdown, Quarto, and R Markdown documents with the
    'Panache' formatter. The formatting engine is implemented in Rust and is
    compiled from source when the package is installed. Functions are provided
    for formatting character strings and files, together with addins for
    formatting documents open in the 'RStudio' integrated development
    environment.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/jolars/panache-r, https://panache.bz
BugReports: https://github.com/jolars/panache-r/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Suggests:
    rstudioapi,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >= 1.89.0
